Brasileirao_Matches.csv 2019, there are teams normalizing to \"atletico\" that are actually two different teams. Let me check the raw team names in Brasileirao 2019.\n\nActually the issue: competition \"Brasileirao\" lower == \"brasileirao\". \"Brasileirao (Historical)\".lower() == \"brasileirao (historical)\". So these don't collide. Good. So within Brasileirao 2019 there must be two atletico teams.\n\nLet me check raw names.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_058f5680a0018x0d3mIVTrE23s","sessionID":"ses_fa710145bffe992PbNwQxTi5bS","messageID":"msg_058f543cd001q7Z9ut1kJ0Q4In"}}
